- Restaurants, services and gyms;

- Public transport and metro;

- IC29, Freixo and main road accesses;

- Douro waterfront and green areas.

COMFORT AND QUALITY

- Kitchen equipped with Bosch appliances;

- Silestone countertops;

- Air conditioning and central vacuum;

- Heat pump;

- Thermal and acoustic insulation;

- LED lighting;

- Frames with thermal cut and double glazing.

Ready to move in.

An exclusive project to live with distinction, comfort and modernity. 

